WEBVTT

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:31.269
Everyone said it was crazy because they
still thought the world was flat,

00:01:31.269 --> 00:01:32.968
but he knew better.

00:01:32.968 --> 00:01:36.308
And when in 1492 he
sailed the ocean blue,

00:01:36.308 --> 00:01:38.423
he found something better
than India:

00:01:38.423 --> 00:01:40.593
a whole new continent."

00:01:40.593 --> 00:01:42.200
"What rubbish.

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:46.794
First of all, educated people knew
the world was round since Aristotle.

00:01:46.794 --> 00:01:49.814
Secondly, Columbus didn't 
discover anything.

00:01:49.814 --> 00:01:52.867
There were already people living here
for millennia.

00:01:52.867 --> 00:01:55.272
And he wasn't even 
the first European to visit.

00:01:55.272 --> 00:01:59.561
The Norse had settled Newfoundland
almost 500 years before."

00:01:59.561 --> 00:02:02.737
"You don't say, so how come we're not
all wearing those cow helmets?"